TITLE Mix then heat in 10 steps using incremental reactions
SOLUTION 1
    temp      20
    units     mol/kgw
    pH        7
    C(4)      0.05
SOLUTION 2
    temp      20
    units     mol/kgw
    pH        7
    Ca        0.05
MIX 1
    1 0.5
    2 0.5
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite 0 10
REACTION_TEMPERATURE 1
    20 200 in 10 steps
INCREMENTAL_REACTIONS true
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected2.out
    -reset false
    -temperature true
    -equilibrium_phases Calcite
END
